Source: polilinux
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Polinetwork <polinetwork@example.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (=13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: polilinux-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kubuntu-desktop, polilinux-tools, polilinux-guest-integration
Recommends: polilinux-extras
Description: Polilinux desktop environment; Meta-package that installs the full Polilinux system for Politecnico di Milano students.

Package: polilinux-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, build-essential, gdb, git, kate, vim, ghdl, kicad, gtkwave, sl, fastfetch, neofetch, htop
Description: Development and engineering tools for Polilinux Compilers, editors and tools used in Politecnico courses.

Package: polilinux-guest-integration
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, open-vm-tools-desktop, spice-vdagent, spice-webdavd, qemu-guest-agent, virtualbox-guest-utils, virtualbox-guest-x11
Description: Virtual Machine integration for Polilinux. Guest tools for VMWare (both Fusion and Workstation), Virtualbox, QEMU and UTM. Improve performance and stability.

Package: polilinux-extras
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, librecad, blender, dia, xournalpp
Description: Extra tools for architecture and note taking. Not intended for professional use, (unfortunately) there's Windows for that.

Package: polilinux-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Polilinux identity and branding
 System identity (os-release, lsb-release, issue) and neofetch logo.
